# Deny by default: only the assistant's package source and lockfile enter the build.
# Tests, evals, data, credentials and the web app never do.
**
!services/schools-assistant/pyproject.toml
!services/schools-assistant/uv.lock
!services/schools-assistant/README.md
!services/schools-assistant/src/
!services/schools-assistant/src/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
